&lt;p&gt;    Got it @prabhjyotsingh - thanks.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    So there are two separate ways to export data now - &lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;1&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt; is the newer way and &lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;2&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt; is the older way.&lt;br/&gt;
