    Should we leave just &lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;1&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt; if this newer export through Angular-ui-grid seems to be better?&lt;br/&gt;
    For example, I think it might be a little bit confusing to users to have two different ways to exprot csv.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    Thanks.&lt;/p&gt;

